# Pick ONE can and place it (cobot_node choreography). The layer loop lives
# in the task manager, which sends these goals sequentially.
# Cancel policy: honored at the next safe phase boundary — never between
# grip and lift, so a cancel can leave the arm holding a can at the check
# position (result.message says which phase it stopped in).
CanTarget target
---
bool success
string message
---
string phase    # check / approach / grip / lift / place — mirrors choreography
